        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Catolonizer</strong> – an exciting online social deduction game for up to 15 players! Complete tasks to earn coins, deceive others, uncover secrets, and decide who you can trust.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player has a hidden role: <strong>Catolonizer</strong>, <strong>Suspect</strong>, or <strong>Neutral</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catolonizers aim to protect the colony, Suspects must eliminate everyone without getting caught, and Neutrals pursue their own unique objectives.<br>Earn coins by completing tasks, purchase items from the Merchant, and use strategic actions at night to shift the balance of the game.<br>Be careful — every night brings new surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eşyalar:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Binoculars(Catolonizer):</u></i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181260/extras/51d4bdc179b5e8f1114602891dcf08d6.avif?t=1759842157\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Basic:</u> Visit the selected target at night and see who visited them that night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Charged:</u> Visit the selected dead player and see who visited them the previous night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Dedective Lens(Catolonizer):</u></i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181260/extras/bd584646c3f501b1172552066f0b9c4f.avif?t=1759842157\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Basic:</u> Visit the selected target at night and see two possible guesses of their secret item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Charged:</u> Visit the selected target at night and reveal their exact secret item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Medical Bag(Catolonizer):</u></i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181260/extras/9b37483a634722e3642ccbbc47aee90d.avif?t=1759842157\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Basic:</u> Visit the selected target at night. If they were attacked, revive them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Charged:</u> Revive the selected dead player in the morning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Sleep Drug(Catolonizer):</u></i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181260/extras/89a392e2e42eaa180590c9c7050251ed.avif?t=1759842157\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Basic:</u> Visit the selected target at night and put them to sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Charged:</u> Visit two selected targets at night and put them both to sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>GPS Tracker(Catolonizer):</u></i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181260/extras/02a887d400ba1aa4adabdafd9e56e3b7.avif?t=1759842157\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Basic:</u> Visit the selected target at night. If they visit someone, see their destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Charged:</u> Visit the selected target at night and see all their previous destinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Knife(Imposter):</u></i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181260/extras/44f54d85b23c69e943d0247e8ccea3bf.avif?t=1759842157\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Basic:</u> Visit the selected target at night and kill them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Charged:</u> Visit and kill two selected targets at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Poison Bottle(Imposter):</u></i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181260/extras/426e7469a7637bdf84161615158c1714.avif?t=1759842157\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Basic:</u> Visit the selected target at night and poison them. They will die randomly during the morning discussion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Charged:</u> Visit the selected target at night and instantly kill them with poison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Shelter Key(Neutral):</u></i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181260/extras/05f163adb8def687d554580453c3db8f.avif?t=1759842157\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Basic:</u> Stay in the shelter at night. While inside, you cannot be killed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Charged:</u> You are immune to roleblocks. You and the selected target stay in the shelter at night and cannot be killed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Wand(Neutral):</u></i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181260/extras/65ab758867aac94f7041902c67266a96.avif?t=1759842157\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Basic:</u> Visit the selected target at night and reveal their exact secret item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Charged:</u> Guess the secret item of the selected target. If correct, they die; if wrong, you die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Chaos:</strong> Engage in intense deception and survival matches with up to 15 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Your Hidden Ability:</strong> Every player has a secret item that determines what actions they can take at night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social Deduction Gameplay:</strong> Discuss, strategize, and vote to figure out who can be trusted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Matches:</strong> Each game plays out differently depending on the choices made by you and your friends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outsmart your opponents and lead your team to victory?<br>Join the Catolonizer community and find out!</p>",
